# The per-platform native libraries under src/code/<arch>-<platform>/ are
# committed on purpose (suite rule 5: a native change refreshes its committed
# binary in the same change), so git's diff/merge behaviour on them is pinned
# here rather than left to its heuristics. Carried from the suite root's
# .gitattributes so it holds in this member's own repository too.
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.exp binary
